# Quote collection.

title "On Building Tools"
text "A few lines I keep coming back to."

space

quote "The best tool is the one you forget you are using." "Frank Chimero"
quote "Write the code you wish someone had written for you." "Kenzi Pick"
quote "Boring technology is exciting when it ships." "Dan McKinley"
quote "Indentation is the original syntax highlighter." "EZHTML team"
